Reviewed upstream release: 1.6.0.

@kimen/angular is generated by Stencil's Angular output target, which copies
its component helpers (angular-component-lib/utils.ts and
angular-component-lib/boolean-attribute.ts) and its base value accessor
(value-accessor.ts) into packages/angular/src/directives, and writes the
remaining value accessors from its templates. The Angular package build
bundles them into fesm2022/kimen-angular.mjs, and its source map carries
their sources.

